Tutor: What do you like to do?
#objective: Tell an activity you like
#chunks: I like to read.,I listen to music every day.,I watch movies on weekends.
#user_input
Tutor: I like to watch movies.
#objective: Show you share the interest
#chunks: I like to read.,I watch movies on weekends.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you listen to music?
#objective: Say yes and how often
#chunks: I listen to music every day.,I like to read.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you play sports?
#objective: Say no honestly
#chunks: I like to read.,I watch movies on weekends.
#user_input
Tutor: What do you do on weekends?
#objective: Tell your weekend activities
#chunks: I watch movies on weekends.,I listen to music every day.
#user_input
Tutor: I watch movies and play games.
#objective: Complete the exchange naturally
#chunks: I like to read.,I listen to music every day.,I watch movies on weekends.
#user_input
Tutor: Great! You can now talk about hobbies and weekend activities.
